<title>USA: Newhall sees Q1 gain from property sale.</title>
<headline>Newhall sees Q1 gain from property sale.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Calif. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Newhall Land and Farming Co said Friday it will gain $12.8 million, or $0.37 per unit, from the sale of its 208-unit StoneCreek Apartment Complex.</p>
<p>The gross proceeds will add $18.3 million to revenues, which will be booked in the first quarter ending March 31, the company said.</p>
